10. **Electronic Property "Clustering" by Functional Groups**: Perform a latent space analysis on intensive properties (gap, mu, homo, lumo) to see if molecules naturally group into "electronic archetypes" based on common SMILES-derived substructures. This objective is to identify if distinct "electronic families" emerge without predefined chemical labels.
\end{IDEAS}


